WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
You, you, you rebels

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:03,760
Sloppy, don't come here

3
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:04,920
This general is an official of the imperial court

4
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:07,720
First of all, a certain family is a civil servant, not a fierce man.

5
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:09,920
Secondly, you, a little thief, bully others too much.

6
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:11,240
The worst thing is that this corrupt official is not in a good position.

7
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:12,320
Princess Zhang, save me

8
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:13,760
I will thank you greatly today

9
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:19,560
Give up the evil spirit in a certain family's heart, Your Highness

10
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:21,040
A certain family banned loyalty in the army

11
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,160
Advise you

12
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,880
But now I have no choice but to kill the commander-in-chief of the imperial court

13
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:25,800
The imperial court will never take the opportunity to resign in order to avoid causing harm to His Highness.

14
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,550
A certain family said goodbye today

15
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:29,990
Fuck your bullshit court, Mr. Li, I won’t do it anymore.

16
00:00:29,990 --> 00:00:31,390
We came here because of Mr. Li

17
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:32,550
I'll take my leave

18
00:00:32,550 --> 00:00:33,590
We won't do it either

19
00:00:33,590 --> 00:00:36,290
Chasing Mr. Li to Death

20
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:38,170
Your Highness is very kind to a certain family.

21
00:00:38,170 --> 00:00:39,890
A certain family will never make things difficult for His Highness

22
00:00:39,890 --> 00:00:41,850
Say goodbye to this and take care Mr. Li

23
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:42,890
There is something very strange about this matter

24
00:00:42,890 --> 00:00:44,810
I have sent extra manpower to the royal capital for a thorough investigation.

25
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:45,890
There will be a secret report soon

26
00:00:45,890 --> 00:00:47,410
If Mr. Kai Shek still wants to leave

27
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:49,330
I will never stop you

28
00:00:49,330 --> 00:00:51,130
A certain family sent a letter to His Highness once

29
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:52,290
Thank you sir for your understanding

30
00:00:52,290 --> 00:00:53,490
A journey of wind and hard work

31
00:00:53,490 --> 00:00:54,730
Sir, please go to the city quickly and have a rest.
